docs {
  # Emeka — The Hustling Agent (Port Harcourt)

  29 years old. Solo agent on a bike. Verified badge, 4.8 rating, 23 closed
  deals — every signal the platform surfaces is the difference between getting
  the call and losing it to a no-name agency.

  This walkthrough goes: register → submit credentials → check my badge /
  invites / profile signals → try to do agent work (open slots on a listing).

  It also probes two changes the post-audit promised:
  - `closedDealCount` / `responseRate` on `GET /users/{id}/profile`
  - `status` filter on `GET /agent-listings/mine`

  I do not have an owner or admin to collaborate with in this run, so the
  invite-and-accept loop is observation only. I record what I *can* see from
  the agent side of the contract.
}
